MARKET DRIVERS

Rising Residential Pest Concerns
Homeowners are increasingly aware that pantry infesting moths compromise food safety and cause measurable economic loss. The Moth Control Market benefits from this heightened vigilance, as consumers replace legacy sprays with targeted, low residue solutions that promise longer protection cycles.
Adoption of Integrated Pest Management
Facility managers in hospitality and food service sectors are integrating non chemical monitoring tools with selective biocides. This shift validates the demand for products that align with IPM guidelines, driving manufacturers to innovate around efficacy, safety, and compliance.
